- The business information and original review text in `new-relook-barbershop-project.md`.
- Existing shared components and the supplied visual reference when available.
- Real shop, barber and haircut images remain pending until Phase 5. Build replaceable image slots with deliberate draft behavior.

### Phase 4 tasks

1. Read the earlier phase outputs and inspect the existing website before editing.
2. Implement the remaining sections in the agreed order using shared components.
3. Centralize service, review, contact and gallery data for easy confirmation and updates.
4. Add header/footer anchor links and connect all booking, call, Instagram, directions and review actions.
5. Adapt grids, typography, orange bands and gallery presentation for mobile.
6. Use faithful attributed review excerpts and keep unconfirmed details out of public copy.
7. Verify the complete page flow, link destinations and keyboard/mobile interactions.
8. Save section implementation notes and remaining content/assets in `phase-4-page-notes.md`.

